      "text": "Subject:- Swearing-in ceremony -"
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "type": "text",
      "order": 6,
      "poly": [
        151.13,
        241.65,
        489.68,
        241.65,
        489.68,
        286.28,
        151.13,
        286.28
      ],
      "text": "The undersigned is directed to say that the\nCouncil of Ministers as shown in Annexure have\nrelinquished their respective offices with effect from\nthe forenoon of 14th January, 1980."
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "type": "text",
      "order": 7,
      "poly": [
        149.34,
        295.54,
        489.68,
        295.54,
        489.68,
        357.85,
        149.34,
        357.85
      ],
      "text": "2. Smt. Indira Gandhi has been sworn-in as the\nPrime Minister by the President at 10-45 A.M. today,\n14th January, 1980, in the Rashtrapati Bhavan. Other\nMinisters sworn-in by the President at 10-45 A.M. today,\n14th January, 1980 are shown at Annexure 'B'."
    },
    {
      "id": 8,
      "type": "text",
      "order": 8,
      "poly": [
        149.94,
        367.95,
        498.01,
        367.95,
        498.01,
        409.21,
        149.94,
        409.21
      ],
      "text": "3. Ministry of Home Affairs may kindly take\nsuch action as may be considered necessary regarding\nissue of Gazette notifications, etc."
    },
    {
      "id": 9,
      "type": "text",
      "order": 9,
      "poly": [
